{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crowd-performance","title":"人群性能与实例化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/practice/crowd-performance","wordCount":1694,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"crowd-lod","title":"模拟 LOD 与剔除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/practice/crowd-lod","wordCount":1515,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"crowd-animation","title":"人群动画与变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/crowd-simulation-flocking/practice/crowd-animation","wordCount":1562,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"实践\">实践</h1><p>前三章给了你正确的算法：群体如何成形、人群如何流动、agent 如何不撞。但&quot;正确&quot;和&quot;能在 60 帧里跑两万人&quot;之间，隔着一整套工程优化。这一章面对真实引擎，回答最后一个问题：怎么把前面的模拟规模拉到十万级，同时让它跑得动、看起来也不像复制粘贴。</p>\n<p>第一篇 <a href=\"crowd-performance\">人群性能与实例化</a> 是性能地基。它讲清把人群推到大规模的三件核心工具：用数据导向设计（ECS）把 agent 数据排成连续数组榨干 CPU 缓存与多线程、用空间划分把邻居查询从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、用 GPU 实例化（GPU instancing）一次绘制调用画出成千上万个体。这是 2025 年 Unity DOTS 能跑五万动画 agent 的底层原因。</p>\n<p>第二篇 <a href=\"crowd-lod\">模拟 LOD 与剔除</a> 讲&quot;把算力花在刀刃上&quot;。镜头看不见的、远处的 agent 不该和近景同等精度地模拟。本篇讲模拟层面的细节分级（远处降低更新频率、简化避障、甚至退化为统计群体）与各种剔除（视锥、遮挡、距离），把省下的算力还给真正可见的人群。</p>\n<p>第三篇 <a href=\"crowd-animation\">人群动画与变体</a> 解决&quot;看起来不假&quot;。一万个人若动作、外形、节奏完全一致，再流畅也出戏。本篇讲动画实例化、随机相位、外观变体、以及大规模下的动画 LOD（impostor/烘焙动画），让人群既省又有个性。</p>\n<p>本章是整个 hub 的收口——把前三章的算法装进可发布的游戏里。读完它，你就拥有了从单只 boid 到十万级动画人群的完整能力。</p>\n"}